1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,398
This tank is full of salad oil.

2
00:00:02,408 --> 00:00:03,212
It isn't.

3
00:00:03,222 --> 00:00:06,534
In nineteen sixty-three, Tino De Angelis borrowed millions

4
00:00:06,544 --> 00:00:07,817
against tanks like this.

5
00:00:07,827 --> 00:00:09,959
American Express vouched for the oil.

6
00:00:09,969 --> 00:00:11,454
Banks handed him cash.

7
00:00:11,464 --> 00:00:13,709
But inspectors only checked the top.

8
00:00:13,719 --> 00:00:14,559
Underneath?

9
00:00:14,577 --> 00:00:15,222
Water.

10
00:00:15,232 --> 00:00:16,552
Hidden compartments.

11
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,170
Secret pipes moving the same oil from tank

12
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,673
to tank, so it got counted again and

13
00:00:21,713 --> 00:00:22,217
again.

14
00:00:22,227 --> 00:00:24,924
On paper: nine hundred thousand tons.

15
00:00:24,934 --> 00:00:27,495
Actually there: fifty-five thousand.

16
00:00:27,505 --> 00:00:29,748
More oil than the whole country had.

17
00:00:29,758 --> 00:00:31,457
Then the market cracked.

18
00:00:31,467 --> 00:00:32,819
Fifty-one lenders.

19
00:00:32,829 --> 00:00:35,105
A hundred and eighty million dollars.

20
00:00:35,115 --> 00:00:35,730
Gone.

21
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,259
He got twenty years.

22
00:00:37,269 --> 00:00:38,637
Walked out in seven.

23
00:00:38,647 --> 00:00:40,054
The tanks were full.

24
00:00:40,064 --> 00:00:41,784
Just not of oil.
